<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dapoer Pasta - Spesialis Pasta Brulee</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #fff8f0;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #c84b31;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .tagline {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid #ffe3d1;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #fffdfa;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e07a5f;
      color: white;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .menu-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #2d3142;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .description {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .price-list {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding-top: 15px;
      border-top: 1px dashed #e2d4c9;
    }
    .price-item span {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #888;
    }
    .price-item strong {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #c84b31;
    }
    .btn-order {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #25d366;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
      transition: background 0.3 alt;
    }
    .btn-order:hover {
      background-color: #1ebe57;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="container">
    <h1>🍝 Dapoer Pasta</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Lezatnya pasta panggang gurih dengan lapisan bechamel & keju lumer</p>

    <div class="card">
      <span class="badge">Menu Favorit</span>
      <h2 class="menu-title">Spaghetti Brulee Panggang</h2>
      <p class="description">
        Perpaduan pasta bolognese daging sapi cincang pilihan, ditutup saus bechamel lembut dan keju mozarella panggang yang kecokelatan.
      </p>

      <div class="price-list">
        <div class="price-item">
          <span>Personal Size</span>
          <strong>Rp35.000</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="price-item">
          <span>Medium Size</span>
          <strong>Rp65.000</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="price-item">
          <span>Family Size</span>
          <strong>Rp120.000</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Ganti nomor WhatsApp di bawah ini dengan nomormu -->
    <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Dapoer%20Pasta,%20saya%20mau%20pesan%20Pasta%20Brulee" class="btn-order" target="_blank">
      Pesan via WhatsApp
    </a>

    <footer>
      &copy; 2026 Dapoer Pasta. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
